function group to clear AN7583_MDC_0_GPIO_MODE_MASK (bit 25) and
AN7583_MDIO_0_GPIO_MODE_MASK (bit 26) of REG_GPIO_PON_MODE. Both bits
are cleared by the hwinit at probe.

